//! The reference client's design system, compiled from its own stylesheets.
//!
//! **Generated by `tools/gen_theme.py`. Do not edit.**
//!
//! Everything in this file is a value read out of the Modrinth App's vendored
//! CSS -- its palette, its radii and gaps, its bare numbers, its cubic-bezier
//! curves, the text it cannot express as a scalar, and the motion it declares.
//! The tool resolves `@extend` and `var()` indirection the way the cascade
//! would, so a token here is the value a browser would paint, not a copy of
//! the line that set it.
//!
//! This exists because the shell used to carry a hand-written palette beside a
//! test-only table of transcribed values, and they could disagree -- they did.
//! One module, generated, is the point.
//!
//! Sources, at the commit pinned in `vendor/modrinth-app/UPSTREAM.md`: 
//! `vendor/modrinth-app/assets/styles/variables.scss` and the motion declared across 
//! `vendor/modrinth-app/`. Regenerate with `python tools/gen_theme.py`; the 
//! gate is `python tools/gen_theme.py --check`.

